The '''Water Worm''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}} in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Water Worm''' can be fished up in the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}}. It requires {{skl|fishing|15}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Water Worm''' is {{Green|300}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|6.13%|1|16.32|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
{| class="wikitable"
!Condition
!<span title="Stacks multiplicatively">Weight</span>
|-
|{{Item|Whale Bait}}, {{Item|Light Bait}}, and {{Item|Dark Bait}}
|{{Green|1.25x}}
|-
|}

{{Item|Worm Bait}} can be used to only catch '''Worms'''.
